  "description": {
   "en": "Boyoung and Haewon have been in a long-term relationship for 10 years, ever since their university days.\nDespite the cold realities of life and an uncertain future, the two have supported and leaned on each other through it all.\nBut at some point, they began to bicker.\nThey thought they knew each other better than anyone after a decade together,\nbut the longer they’re together, the harder it becomes to understand one another."
